window.Apuntes.registrarPane("pyl/u4/teoria", "<section class=\"pane\" data-view=\"pyl/u4/teoria\" data-tab-owner=\"teoria\">\n  <h1>Unidad 4 &mdash; Dise\u00f1ar un aut\u00f3mata y una ER</h1>\n\n  <p class=\"pane-intro\">\n    El ejercicio 3 del parcial (20 puntos): <em>\"Realice un AFD o AFND (y una Expresi\u00f3n Regular)\n    para...\"</em> un lenguaje dicho con palabras. No hay algoritmo: hay un m\u00e9todo para pensar y\n    unas pocas formas que se repiten siempre. Los ejercicios salen del Trabajo Pr\u00e1ctico I de la\n    c\u00e1tedra.\n  </p>\n\n  <div class=\"bloque\" data-abierta>\n    <p class=\"kicker\">Antes de leer</p>\n    <h2>C\u00f3mo leer esta unidad</h2>\n    <div class=\"tabla-wrap\">\n      <table class=\"t full\">\n        <tr><th>Secci\u00f3n</th><th>Qu\u00e9 tiene</th></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">1. El m\u00e9todo</td><td>Cinco pasos: ejemplos, qu\u00e9 recordar, estados, transiciones, probar</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">2. Las formas que se repiten</td><td>Empieza con, termina con, contiene, no contiene, paridad, longitud</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">3. Combinar condiciones</td><td>\"y\" (recordar dos cosas a la vez), \"o\" (dos caminos) y pensar por ramas</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">4. La ER</td><td>C\u00f3mo escribirla por piezas o sacarla del aut\u00f3mata</td></tr>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n    <p>Despu\u00e9s, la Pr\u00e1ctica tiene doce ejercicios del TP I resueltos.</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"bloque\">\n    <p class=\"kicker\">Para pensar</p>\n    <h2>1. El m\u00e9todo</h2>\n\n    <ol>\n      <li><strong>Ejemplos.</strong> Escrib\u00ed 4 o 5 cadenas que s\u00ed y 4 o 5 que no, incluidos los bordes: \u03b5, una sola letra, la m\u00e1s corta que entra. Los ejemplos de la consigna tambi\u00e9n se prueban.</li>\n      <li><strong>\u00bfQu\u00e9 tiene que recordar?</strong> El aut\u00f3mata no tiene memoria: solo sabe en qu\u00e9 estado est\u00e1. Preguntate qu\u00e9 necesit\u00e1s saber de lo le\u00eddo hasta ahora para decidir: \"\u00bfya vi el prefijo?\", \"\u00bfla cantidad es par o impar?\", \"\u00bfqu\u00e9 fue lo \u00faltimo?\".</li>\n      <li><strong>Un estado por cada situaci\u00f3n.</strong> Hac\u00e9 una tabla Estado | Qu\u00e9 significa. Marc\u00e1 el inicial (la situaci\u00f3n \"no le\u00ed nada\") y los finales (las situaciones que cumplen la condici\u00f3n).</li>\n      <li><strong>Transiciones.</strong> Para cada estado y cada s\u00edmbolo: \"si estoy en esta situaci\u00f3n y leo esto, \u00bfen qu\u00e9 situaci\u00f3n quedo?\".</li>\n      <li><strong>Probar.</strong> Recorr\u00e9 tus ejemplos del paso 1. Si uno falla, el error est\u00e1 en una situaci\u00f3n mal pensada.</li>\n    </ol>\n\n    <h3 class=\"h-ej\">Ejemplo: empiezan con ab</h3>\n    <div class=\"caja caja-ejemplo\">\n      <p>Cadenas sobre {a, b} que empiezan con ab.</p>\n    </div>\n    <ol>\n      <li>S\u00ed: <code>ab</code>, <code>aba</code>, <code>abbb</code>. No: <code>\u03b5</code>, <code>a</code>, <code>ba</code>, <code>aab</code>.</li>\n      <li>Hay que recordar cu\u00e1nto del prefijo <code>ab</code> ya se vio.</li>\n      <li>\n        <div class=\"tabla-wrap\">\n          <table class=\"t full\">\n            <tr><th>Estado</th><th>Qu\u00e9 significa</th></tr>\n            <tr><td class=\"lbl\">q0 (inicial)</td><td>No le\u00ed nada</td></tr>\n            <tr><td class=\"lbl\">q1</td><td>Le\u00ed la a del principio</td></tr>\n            <tr><td class=\"lbl\">q2 (final)</td><td>Ya le\u00ed ab: lo que venga no importa</td></tr>\n          </table>\n        </div>\n      </li>\n      <li>q0 &rarr;a q1, q1 &rarr;b q2, q2 &rarr;a,b q2. Lo dem\u00e1s (q0 con b, q1 con a) no tiene arreglo: va al muerto, o se deja sin flecha en un AFND.</li>\n    </ol>\n    <div class=\"pd-grafico af\" data-g=\"u4-empieza\">\n      <svg viewBox=\"-61 -77 401 108\" width=\"401\" height=\"108\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Empiezan con ab\">\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M19.0,0.0 L125.0,0.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M125.0,0.0 L116.0,4.5 L116.0,-4.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"72.0\" y=\"-10.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">a</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M163.0,0.0 L269.0,0.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M269.0,0.0 L260.0,4.5 L260.0,-4.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"216.0\" y=\"-10.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">b</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M279.1,-16.8 C248.0,-51.2 328.0,-51.2 296.9,-16.8\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M296.9,-16.8 L299.6,-26.5 L306.3,-20.4 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"288.0\" y=\"-56.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">a, b</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M-49.0,0.0 L-19.0,0.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M-19.0,0.0 L-28.0,4.5 L-28.0,-4.5 Z\"/>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"0.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"0.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">q0</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"144.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"144.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">q1</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"288.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"288.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"15\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"288.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">q2</text>\n        </g>\n      </svg>\n    </div>\n    <p>ER: <code class=\"er\">ab<span class=\"er-p er-p0\">(</span>a<span class=\"er-o\">|</span>b<span class=\"er-p er-p0\">)</span><span class=\"er-k\">*</span></code>.</p>\n\n    <div class=\"caja caja-ojo\">\n      <span class=\"caja-tit\">Errores y trampas</span>\n      <ul>\n        <li>Saltear el paso 1: la mayor\u00eda de los errores son casos borde (\u03b5, una letra) que nadie prob\u00f3.</li>\n        <li>Hacer un estado por cada cadena posible: los estados son <strong>situaciones</strong>, no cadenas.</li>\n        <li>Leer \"y\" como \"o\" en la consigna: \"empiezan con aa <strong>o</strong> con b, <strong>y</strong> tienen cantidad par de a\" son dos condiciones que se cumplen a la vez (la primera ya trae un \"o\" adentro).</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"bloque\">\n    <p class=\"kicker\">De bolsillo</p>\n    <h2>2. Las formas que se repiten</h2>\n    <p>Casi todas las consignas son una de estas formas, o dos combinadas (secci\u00f3n 3). Todas sobre {a, b} o {0, 1}; con otro alfabeto se cambian las letras.</p>\n\n    <div class=\"tabla-wrap\">\n      <table class=\"t full\">\n        <tr><th>Forma</th><th>Qu\u00e9 recuerda</th><th>ER</th></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">Empieza con w</td><td>Cu\u00e1nto de w ya le\u00ed; despu\u00e9s, nada</td><td><code class=\"er\">w<span class=\"er-p er-p0\">(</span>a<span class=\"er-o\">|</span>b<span class=\"er-p er-p0\">)</span><span class=\"er-k\">*</span></code></td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">Termina con w</td><td>Cu\u00e1nto del final de lo le\u00eddo coincide con el principio de w</td><td><code class=\"er\"><span class=\"er-p er-p0\">(</span>a<span class=\"er-o\">|</span>b<span class=\"er-p er-p0\">)</span><span class=\"er-k\">*</span>w</code></td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">Contiene w</td><td>Cu\u00e1nto de w llevo; al completarlo, final para siempre</td><td><code class=\"er\"><span class=\"er-p er-p0\">(</span>a<span class=\"er-o\">|</span>b<span class=\"er-p er-p0\">)</span><span class=\"er-k\">*</span>w<span class=\"er-p er-p0\">(</span>a<span class=\"er-o\">|</span>b<span class=\"er-p er-p0\">)</span><span class=\"er-k\">*</span></code></td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">No contiene w</td><td>El AFD de \"contiene w\" con finales y no finales <strong>al rev\u00e9s</strong></td><td>Sale del aut\u00f3mata (Unidad 2)</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">Cantidad par de x</td><td>Par o impar (2 estados)</td><td>ver abajo</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">Longitud m\u00faltiplo de n</td><td>El resto de dividir lo le\u00eddo por n (n estados en ciclo)</td><td><code>((a|b)<sup>n veces</sup>)*</code></td></tr>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n\n    <h3>Termina con ab</h3>\n    <div class=\"pd-grafico af\" data-g=\"u4-termina\">\n      <svg viewBox=\"-61 -78 396 169\" width=\"396\" height=\"169\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Terminan en ab\">\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M-8.9,-16.8 C-40.0,-51.2 40.0,-51.2 8.9,-16.8\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M8.9,-16.8 L11.6,-26.5 L18.3,-20.4 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"0.0\" y=\"-56.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">b</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M19.0,0.0 L133.0,0.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M133.0,0.0 L124.0,4.5 L124.0,-4.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"76.0\" y=\"-10.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">a</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M143.1,-16.8 C112.0,-51.2 192.0,-51.2 160.9,-16.8\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M160.9,-16.8 L163.6,-26.5 L170.3,-20.4 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"152.0\" y=\"-56.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">a</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M171.0,0.0 L285.0,0.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M285.0,0.0 L276.0,4.5 L276.0,-4.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"228.0\" y=\"-10.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">b</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M290.9,-13.8 Q228.0,-80.0 165.1,-13.8\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M165.1,-13.8 L168.0,-23.4 L174.5,-17.2 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"228.0\" y=\"-56.9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">a</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M288.6,11.1 Q152.0,110.0 15.4,11.1\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M15.4,11.1 L25.3,12.8 L20.0,20.1 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"152.0\" y=\"70.6\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">b</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M-49.0,0.0 L-19.0,0.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M-19.0,0.0 L-28.0,4.5 L-28.0,-4.5 Z\"/>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"0.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"0.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">q0</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"152.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"152.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">q1</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"304.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"304.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"15\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"304.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">q2</text>\n        </g>\n      </svg>\n    </div>\n    <p>\n      La trampa est\u00e1 en las flechas de vuelta: desde q2 (\"lo \u00faltimo fue ab\"), una a no lleva al\n      principio sino a q1, porque esa a puede ser el comienzo de un nuevo ab.\n    </p>\n\n    <h3>Contiene ab (AFD)</h3>\n    <div class=\"pd-grafico af\" data-g=\"u4-contiene\">\n      <svg viewBox=\"-61 -77 417 108\" width=\"417\" height=\"108\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Contienen ab (AFD)\">\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M-8.9,-16.8 C-40.0,-51.2 40.0,-51.2 8.9,-16.8\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M8.9,-16.8 L11.6,-26.5 L18.3,-20.4 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"0.0\" y=\"-56.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">b</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M19.0,0.0 L133.0,0.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M133.0,0.0 L124.0,4.5 L124.0,-4.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"76.0\" y=\"-10.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">a</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M143.1,-16.8 C112.0,-51.2 192.0,-51.2 160.9,-16.8\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M160.9,-16.8 L163.6,-26.5 L170.3,-20.4 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"152.0\" y=\"-56.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">a</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M171.0,0.0 L285.0,0.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M285.0,0.0 L276.0,4.5 L276.0,-4.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"228.0\" y=\"-10.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">b</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M295.1,-16.8 C264.0,-51.2 344.0,-51.2 312.9,-16.8\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M312.9,-16.8 L315.6,-26.5 L322.3,-20.4 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"304.0\" y=\"-56.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">a, b</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M-49.0,0.0 L-19.0,0.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M-19.0,0.0 L-28.0,4.5 L-28.0,-4.5 Z\"/>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"0.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"0.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">q0</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"152.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"152.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">q1</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"304.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"304.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"15\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"304.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">q2</text>\n        </g>\n      </svg>\n    </div>\n    <p>q0: \"todav\u00eda no empez\u00f3\"; q1: \"lo \u00faltimo fue a\"; q2: \"ya apareci\u00f3 ab\". Desde q2 no se sale.</p>\n\n    <h3>No contiene ab</h3>\n    <p>El mismo AFD, con los finales dados vuelta. q2 queda como estado muerto.</p>\n    <div class=\"pd-grafico af\" data-g=\"u4-no-contiene\">\n      <svg viewBox=\"-61 -77 417 108\" width=\"417\" height=\"108\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"No contienen ab: el mismo AFD con los finales al rev\u00e9s\">\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M-8.9,-16.8 C-40.0,-51.2 40.0,-51.2 8.9,-16.8\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M8.9,-16.8 L11.6,-26.5 L18.3,-20.4 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"0.0\" y=\"-56.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">b</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M19.0,0.0 L133.0,0.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M133.0,0.0 L124.0,4.5 L124.0,-4.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"76.0\" y=\"-10.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">a</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M143.1,-16.8 C112.0,-51.2 192.0,-51.2 160.9,-16.8\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M160.9,-16.8 L163.6,-26.5 L170.3,-20.4 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"152.0\" y=\"-56.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">a</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M171.0,0.0 L285.0,0.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M285.0,0.0 L276.0,4.5 L276.0,-4.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"228.0\" y=\"-10.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">b</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M295.1,-16.8 C264.0,-51.2 344.0,-51.2 312.9,-16.8\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M312.9,-16.8 L315.6,-26.5 L322.3,-20.4 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"304.0\" y=\"-56.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">a, b</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M-49.0,0.0 L-19.0,0.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M-19.0,0.0 L-28.0,4.5 L-28.0,-4.5 Z\"/>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"0.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"0.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"15\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"0.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">q0</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"152.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"152.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"15\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"152.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">q1</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado muerto\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"304.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"304.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">q2</text>\n        </g>\n      </svg>\n    </div>\n    <p>Mirando el dibujo: primero b, despu\u00e9s a, y nunca una b despu\u00e9s de una a. ER: <code class=\"er\">b<span class=\"er-k\">*</span>a<span class=\"er-k\">*</span></code>.</p>\n    <div class=\"caja caja-ojo\">\n      <span class=\"caja-tit\">El truco del complemento solo vale con AFD</span>\n      <p>Dar vuelta los finales funciona solo si el aut\u00f3mata es determin\u00edstico y <strong>completo</strong> (con su estado muerto). En un AFND da cualquier cosa.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <h3>Cantidad par de 1</h3>\n    <div class=\"pd-grafico af\" data-g=\"u4-paridad\">\n      <svg viewBox=\"-61 -77 273 130\" width=\"273\" height=\"130\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Cantidad par de 1\">\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M17.3,-7.8 Q80.0,-36.0 142.7,-7.8\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M142.7,-7.8 L132.6,-7.4 L136.3,-15.6 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"80.0\" y=\"-31.9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">1</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M142.7,7.8 Q80.0,36.0 17.3,7.8\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M17.3,7.8 L27.4,7.4 L23.7,15.6 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"80.0\" y=\"31.9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">1</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M-8.9,-16.8 C-40.0,-51.2 40.0,-51.2 8.9,-16.8\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M8.9,-16.8 L11.6,-26.5 L18.3,-20.4 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"0.0\" y=\"-56.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">0</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M151.1,-16.8 C120.0,-51.2 200.0,-51.2 168.9,-16.8\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M168.9,-16.8 L171.6,-26.5 L178.3,-20.4 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"160.0\" y=\"-56.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">0</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M-49.0,0.0 L-19.0,0.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M-19.0,0.0 L-28.0,4.5 L-28.0,-4.5 Z\"/>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"0.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"0.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"15\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"0.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">P</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"160.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"160.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">I</text>\n        </g>\n      </svg>\n    </div>\n    <p>\n      P = \"vi una cantidad par de 1\", I = \"impar\". El 0 no cambia la paridad (lazo). ER:\n      <code class=\"er\"><span class=\"er-p er-p0\">(</span>0<span class=\"er-o\">|</span>10<span class=\"er-k\">*</span>1<span class=\"er-p er-p0\">)</span><span class=\"er-k\">*</span></code>: bloques que son un 0 suelto, o dos 1 con ceros en el medio.\n    </p>\n\n    <h3>Longitud m\u00faltiplo de 3</h3>\n    <div class=\"pd-grafico af\" data-g=\"u4-longitud\">\n      <svg viewBox=\"-61 -81 380 112\" width=\"380\" height=\"112\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Longitud m\u00faltiplo de 3\">\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M19.0,0.0 L125.0,0.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M125.0,0.0 L116.0,4.5 L116.0,-4.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"72.0\" y=\"-10.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">a, b</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M163.0,0.0 L269.0,0.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M269.0,0.0 L260.0,4.5 L260.0,-4.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"216.0\" y=\"-10.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">a, b</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M271.9,-10.1 Q144.0,-90.0 16.1,-10.1\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M16.1,-10.1 L21.4,-18.7 L26.1,-11.0 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"144.0\" y=\"-60.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">a, b</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M-49.0,0.0 L-19.0,0.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M-19.0,0.0 L-28.0,4.5 L-28.0,-4.5 Z\"/>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"0.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"0.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"15\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"0.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">q0</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"144.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"144.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">q1</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"288.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"288.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">q2</text>\n        </g>\n      </svg>\n    </div>\n    <p>q0, q1, q2 = \"le\u00ed 0, 1 o 2 s\u00edmbolos de m\u00e1s sobre un m\u00faltiplo de 3\". Cualquier s\u00edmbolo avanza uno en el ciclo. ER: <code class=\"er\"><span class=\"er-p er-p0\">(</span><span class=\"er-p er-p1\">(</span>a<span class=\"er-o\">|</span>b<span class=\"er-p er-p1\">)</span><span class=\"er-p er-p1\">(</span>a<span class=\"er-o\">|</span>b<span class=\"er-p er-p1\">)</span><span class=\"er-p er-p1\">(</span>a<span class=\"er-o\">|</span>b<span class=\"er-p er-p1\">)</span><span class=\"er-p er-p0\">)</span><span class=\"er-k\">*</span></code>.</p>\n\n    <div class=\"caja caja-ojo\">\n      <span class=\"caja-tit\">Errores y trampas</span>\n      <ul>\n        <li>\"Cantidad par\" incluye el <strong>cero</strong>: la cadena sin ese s\u00edmbolo (y \u03b5) entra.</li>\n        <li>En \"termina con\" y \"contiene\", al fallar no siempre se vuelve al inicio: puede que lo le\u00eddo ya sirva como comienzo del patr\u00f3n.</li>\n        <li>\"No contiene\" no se puede escribir directo con una ER de bolsillo: se hace el AFD y, si piden ER, se pasa con la Unidad 2.</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"bloque\">\n    <p class=\"kicker\">Dos condiciones</p>\n    <h2>3. Combinar condiciones</h2>\n\n    <h3>\"y\": recordar dos cosas a la vez</h3>\n    <p>\n      Cada estado guarda <strong>las dos informaciones juntas</strong>: si una condici\u00f3n tiene 2\n      situaciones y la otra 2, hacen falta hasta 2 &times; 2 = 4 estados. Es final el estado donde\n      <strong>se cumplen las dos</strong>.\n    </p>\n\n    <h3 class=\"h-ej\">Ejemplo 1: cantidad par de a y cantidad par de b</h3>\n    <div class=\"tabla-wrap\">\n      <table class=\"t full\">\n        <tr><th>Estado</th><th>Qu\u00e9 significa</th></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">PP (inicial, final)</td><td>a par, b par</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">IP</td><td>a impar, b par</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">PI</td><td>a par, b impar</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">II</td><td>a impar, b impar</td></tr>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n    <p>La a cambia la primera letra (P &harr; I) y la b la segunda.</p>\n    <div class=\"pd-grafico af\" data-g=\"u4-par-par\">\n      <svg viewBox=\"-61 -53 288 265\" width=\"288\" height=\"265\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Cantidad par de a y cantidad par de b\">\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M17.6,-7.2 Q88.0,-36.0 158.4,-7.2\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M158.4,-7.2 L148.4,-6.4 L151.8,-14.8 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"88.0\" y=\"-31.6\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">a</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M158.4,7.2 Q88.0,36.0 17.6,7.2\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M17.6,7.2 L27.6,6.4 L24.2,14.8 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"88.0\" y=\"31.6\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">a</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M17.6,152.8 Q88.0,124.0 158.4,152.8\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M158.4,152.8 L148.4,153.6 L151.8,145.2 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"88.0\" y=\"128.4\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">a</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M158.4,167.2 Q88.0,196.0 17.6,167.2\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M17.6,167.2 L27.6,166.4 L24.2,174.8 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"88.0\" y=\"191.6\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">a</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M7.8,17.3 Q36.0,80.0 7.8,142.7\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M7.8,142.7 L7.4,132.6 L15.6,136.3 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"35.7\" y=\"80.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">b</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M-7.8,142.7 Q-36.0,80.0 -7.8,17.3\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M-7.8,17.3 L-7.4,27.4 L-15.6,23.7 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"-35.7\" y=\"80.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">b</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M183.8,17.3 Q212.0,80.0 183.8,142.7\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M183.8,142.7 L183.4,132.6 L191.6,136.3 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"211.7\" y=\"80.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">b</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M168.2,142.7 Q140.0,80.0 168.2,17.3\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M168.2,17.3 L168.6,27.4 L160.4,23.7 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"140.3\" y=\"80.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">b</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M-49.0,0.0 L-19.0,0.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M-19.0,0.0 L-28.0,4.5 L-28.0,-4.5 Z\"/>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"0.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"0.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"15\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"0.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">PP</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"176.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"176.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">IP</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"0.0\" cy=\"160.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"0.0\" y=\"160.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">PI</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"176.0\" cy=\"160.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"176.0\" y=\"160.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">II</text>\n        </g>\n      </svg>\n    </div>\n    <p><code>abab</code>: PP &rarr;a IP &rarr;b II &rarr;a PI &rarr;b PP. Acepta (dos a y dos b).</p>\n\n    <h3 class=\"h-ej\">Ejemplo 2: empiezan con a y tienen cantidad par de b</h3>\n    <p>\n      A veces una condici\u00f3n se \"termina\" enseguida y las situaciones se achican: \"empieza con a\" solo\n      importa en la primera letra. Despu\u00e9s de esa a, lo \u00fanico que hay que recordar es la paridad de b.\n    </p>\n    <div class=\"tabla-wrap\">\n      <table class=\"t full\">\n        <tr><th>Estado</th><th>Qu\u00e9 significa</th></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">q0 (inicial)</td><td>No le\u00ed nada</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">P (final)</td><td>Empez\u00f3 con a, b par</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">I</td><td>Empez\u00f3 con a, b impar</td></tr>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"pd-grafico af\" data-g=\"u4-combina\">\n      <svg viewBox=\"-61 -5 425 130\" width=\"425\" height=\"130\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Empiezan con a y tienen cantidad par de b\">\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M19.0,72.0 L133.0,72.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M133.0,72.0 L124.0,76.5 L124.0,67.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"76.0\" y=\"62.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">a</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M143.1,55.2 C112.0,20.8 192.0,20.8 160.9,55.2\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M160.9,55.2 L163.6,45.5 L170.3,51.6 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"152.0\" y=\"16.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">a</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M169.3,64.2 Q232.0,36.0 294.7,64.2\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M294.7,64.2 L284.6,64.6 L288.3,56.4 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"232.0\" y=\"40.1\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">b</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M294.7,79.8 Q232.0,108.0 169.3,79.8\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M169.3,79.8 L179.4,79.4 L175.7,87.6 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"232.0\" y=\"103.9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">b</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M303.1,55.2 C272.0,20.8 352.0,20.8 320.9,55.2\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M320.9,55.2 L323.6,45.5 L330.3,51.6 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"312.0\" y=\"16.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">a</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M-49.0,72.0 L-19.0,72.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M-19.0,72.0 L-28.0,76.5 L-28.0,67.5 Z\"/>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"0.0\" cy=\"72.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"0.0\" y=\"72.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">q0</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"152.0\" cy=\"72.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"152.0\" cy=\"72.0\" r=\"15\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"152.0\" y=\"72.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">P</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"312.0\" cy=\"72.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"312.0\" y=\"72.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">I</text>\n        </g>\n      </svg>\n    </div>\n    <p>Si empieza con b, va al muerto (no dibujado). ER: <code class=\"er\">a<span class=\"er-p er-p0\">(</span>a<span class=\"er-o\">|</span>ba<span class=\"er-k\">*</span>b<span class=\"er-p er-p0\">)</span><span class=\"er-k\">*</span></code>: la a obligatoria y despu\u00e9s bloques que son una a, o dos b con a en el medio.</p>\n\n    <h3>\"o\": dos caminos</h3>\n    <p>\n      Con un <strong>AFND</strong> (o un AFN-\u03b5) es lo m\u00e1s f\u00e1cil: un inicial con \u03b5 a un aut\u00f3mata de\n      cada condici\u00f3n. Acepta si alguno de los dos caminos acepta. Es la misma idea que la uni\u00f3n de\n      Thompson. La ER es la uni\u00f3n de las dos: <code class=\"er\">r1<span class=\"er-o\">|</span>r2</code>.\n    </p>\n\n    <h3 class=\"h-ej\">Ejemplo 3: empiezan con aa o terminan con bb</h3>\n    <div class=\"pd-grafico af\" data-g=\"u4-union\">\n      <svg viewBox=\"-61 -52 530 305\" width=\"530\" height=\"305\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"AFN-\u03b5: empiezan con aa o terminan con bb\">\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M15.3,76.8 L104.7,11.2\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M104.7,11.2 L100.1,20.2 L94.8,12.9 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"52.8\" y=\"34.1\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">\u03b5</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M139.0,0.0 L229.0,0.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M229.0,0.0 L220.0,4.5 L220.0,-4.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"184.0\" y=\"-10.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">a</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M267.0,0.0 L357.0,0.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M357.0,0.0 L348.0,4.5 L348.0,-4.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"312.0\" y=\"-10.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">a</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M392.8,-8.9 C427.2,-40.0 427.2,40.0 392.8,8.9\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M392.8,8.9 L402.5,11.6 L396.4,18.3 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"442.2\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">a, b</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M15.3,99.2 L104.7,164.8\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M104.7,164.8 L94.8,163.1 L100.1,155.8 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"67.2\" y=\"122.1\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">\u03b5</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M128.9,192.8 C160.0,227.2 80.0,227.2 111.1,192.8\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M111.1,192.8 L108.4,202.5 L101.7,196.4 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"120.0\" y=\"232.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">a, b</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M139.0,176.0 L229.0,176.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M229.0,176.0 L220.0,180.5 L220.0,171.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"184.0\" y=\"166.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">b</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M267.0,176.0 L357.0,176.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M357.0,176.0 L348.0,180.5 L348.0,171.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"312.0\" y=\"166.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">b</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M-49.0,88.0 L-19.0,88.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M-19.0,88.0 L-28.0,92.5 L-28.0,83.5 Z\"/>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"0.0\" cy=\"88.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"0.0\" y=\"88.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">i</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"120.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"120.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">p0</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"248.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"248.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">p1</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"376.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"376.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"15\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"376.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">p2</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"120.0\" cy=\"176.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"120.0\" y=\"176.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">r0</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"248.0\" cy=\"176.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"248.0\" y=\"176.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">r1</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"376.0\" cy=\"176.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"376.0\" cy=\"176.0\" r=\"15\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"376.0\" y=\"176.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">r2</text>\n        </g>\n      </svg>\n    </div>\n    <ul>\n      <li>Arriba, \"empieza con aa\"; abajo, \"termina con bb\" en versi\u00f3n no determin\u00edstica: r0 se queda leyendo hasta que adivina las dos b finales.</li>\n      <li><code>aaba</code>: el camino de arriba acepta. <code>abb</code>: el de abajo acepta. <code>aba</code>: ninguno.</li>\n      <li>ER: <code class=\"er\">aa<span class=\"er-p er-p0\">(</span>a<span class=\"er-o\">|</span>b<span class=\"er-p er-p0\">)</span><span class=\"er-k\">*</span><span class=\"er-o\">|</span><span class=\"er-p er-p0\">(</span>a<span class=\"er-o\">|</span>b<span class=\"er-p er-p0\">)</span><span class=\"er-k\">*</span>bb</code>.</li>\n    </ul>\n    <p>Si la consigna pide <strong>AFD</strong>, se hace con la idea del \"y\" (recordar las dos cosas) y es final el estado donde se cumple <strong>alguna</strong>.</p>\n\n    <h3>Un \"o\" adentro de un \"y\": pensar por ramas</h3>\n    <p>\n      Cuando la consigna dice \"empiezan con <em>esto</em> o con <em>aquello</em>, y adem\u00e1s...\", lo\n      m\u00e1s f\u00e1cil es <strong>una rama por cada comienzo</strong>, y en cada rama la otra condici\u00f3n.\n      Despu\u00e9s se miran las ramas: los estados que significan lo mismo se juntan.\n    </p>\n\n    <h3 class=\"h-ej\">Ejemplo 4: empiezan con aa o con b, y tienen cantidad par de b</h3>\n    <p>Por ramas: arriba los que empiezan con aa, abajo los que empiezan con b (esa b ya cuenta para la paridad).</p>\n    <div class=\"pd-grafico af\" data-g=\"u4-ramas\">\n      <svg viewBox=\"-61 -77 513 330\" width=\"513\" height=\"330\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Por ramas: una rama para los que empiezan con aa y otra para los que empiezan con b\">\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M15.7,77.2 L112.3,10.8\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M112.3,10.8 L107.5,19.6 L102.4,12.2 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"57.1\" y=\"34.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">a</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M147.0,0.0 L237.0,0.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M237.0,0.0 L228.0,4.5 L228.0,-4.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"192.0\" y=\"-10.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">a</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M247.1,-16.8 C216.0,-51.2 296.0,-51.2 264.9,-16.8\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M264.9,-16.8 L267.6,-26.5 L274.3,-20.4 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"256.0\" y=\"-56.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">a</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M273.0,-8.5 Q328.0,-36.0 383.0,-8.5\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M383.0,-8.5 L372.9,-8.5 L377.0,-16.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"328.0\" y=\"-32.2\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">b</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M383.0,8.5 Q328.0,36.0 273.0,8.5\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M273.0,8.5 L283.1,8.5 L279.0,16.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"328.0\" y=\"32.2\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">b</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M391.1,-16.8 C360.0,-51.2 440.0,-51.2 408.9,-16.8\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M408.9,-16.8 L411.6,-26.5 L418.3,-20.4 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"400.0\" y=\"-56.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">a</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M15.7,98.8 L112.3,165.2\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M112.3,165.2 L102.4,163.8 L107.5,156.4 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"70.9\" y=\"122.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">b</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M136.9,192.8 C168.0,227.2 88.0,227.2 119.1,192.8\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M119.1,192.8 L116.4,202.5 L109.7,196.4 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"128.0\" y=\"232.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">a</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M145.0,167.5 Q200.0,140.0 255.0,167.5\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M255.0,167.5 L244.9,167.5 L249.0,159.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"200.0\" y=\"143.8\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">b</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M255.0,184.5 Q200.0,212.0 145.0,184.5\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M145.0,184.5 L155.1,184.5 L151.0,192.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"200.0\" y=\"208.2\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">b</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M280.9,192.8 C312.0,227.2 232.0,227.2 263.1,192.8\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M263.1,192.8 L260.4,202.5 L253.7,196.4 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"272.0\" y=\"232.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">a</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M-49.0,88.0 L-19.0,88.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M-19.0,88.0 L-28.0,92.5 L-28.0,83.5 Z\"/>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"0.0\" cy=\"88.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"0.0\" y=\"88.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">q0</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"128.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"128.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">r1</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"256.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"256.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"15\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"256.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">R</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"400.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"400.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">S</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"128.0\" cy=\"176.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"128.0\" y=\"176.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">T</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"272.0\" cy=\"176.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"272.0\" cy=\"176.0\" r=\"15\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"272.0\" y=\"176.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">U</text>\n        </g>\n      </svg>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"tabla-wrap\">\n      <table class=\"t full\">\n        <tr><th>Estado</th><th>Qu\u00e9 significa</th></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">r1</td><td>Le\u00ed la primera a de aa</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">R y U (finales)</td><td>Empez\u00f3 bien y la cantidad de b es par</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">S y T</td><td>Empez\u00f3 bien y la cantidad de b es impar</td></tr>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n    <p>\n      Ya est\u00e1 bien as\u00ed. Pero R y U significan lo mismo, y S y T tambi\u00e9n (una vez que empez\u00f3 bien, da\n      igual por cu\u00e1l rama): se juntan en P (par) e I (impar).\n    </p>\n    <div class=\"pd-grafico af\" data-g=\"u4-ramas-junto\">\n      <svg viewBox=\"-61 -52 388 280\" width=\"388\" height=\"280\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Las dos ramas juntas: R y U son el mismo estado (par), S y T tambi\u00e9n (impar)\">\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M15.7,77.2 L112.3,10.8\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M112.3,10.8 L107.5,19.6 L102.4,12.2 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"57.1\" y=\"34.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">a</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M147.0,0.0 L237.0,0.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M237.0,0.0 L228.0,4.5 L228.0,-4.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"192.0\" y=\"-10.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">a</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M272.8,-8.9 C307.2,-40.0 307.2,40.0 272.8,8.9\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M272.8,8.9 L282.5,11.6 L276.4,18.3 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"310.8\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">a</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M263.2,17.6 Q292.0,88.0 263.2,158.4\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M263.2,158.4 L262.4,148.4 L270.8,151.8 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"291.4\" y=\"88.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">b</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M248.8,158.4 Q220.0,88.0 248.8,17.6\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M248.8,17.6 L249.6,27.6 L241.2,24.2 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"220.6\" y=\"88.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">b</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M272.8,167.1 C307.2,136.0 307.2,216.0 272.8,184.9\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M272.8,184.9 L282.5,187.6 L276.4,194.3 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"310.8\" y=\"176.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">a</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M18.0,94.2 L238.0,169.8\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M238.0,169.8 L228.1,171.2 L231.0,162.6 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"131.7\" y=\"121.4\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">b</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M-49.0,88.0 L-19.0,88.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M-19.0,88.0 L-28.0,92.5 L-28.0,83.5 Z\"/>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"0.0\" cy=\"88.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"0.0\" y=\"88.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">q0</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"128.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"128.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">r1</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"256.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"256.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"15\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"256.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">P</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"256.0\" cy=\"176.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"256.0\" y=\"176.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">I</text>\n        </g>\n      </svg>\n    </div>\n    <ul>\n      <li><code>aab</code>: q0 &rarr; r1 &rarr; P &rarr; I. Rechaza (una b).</li>\n      <li><code>bab</code>: q0 &rarr; I &rarr; I &rarr; P. Acepta (dos b, empieza con b).</li>\n      <li><code>ab</code>: q0 &rarr; r1, y r1 no tiene flecha con b. Rechaza (empieza con a pero no con aa).</li>\n    </ul>\n    <p>\n      ER, tambi\u00e9n por ramas: el comienzo (<code>aa</code>, o <code>b</code> seguido de lo que falta\n      para volver a par: <code class=\"er\">ba<span class=\"er-k\">*</span>b</code>) y despu\u00e9s bloques que no cambian la paridad:\n      <code class=\"er\"><span class=\"er-p er-p0\">(</span>aa<span class=\"er-o\">|</span>ba<span class=\"er-k\">*</span>b<span class=\"er-p er-p0\">)</span><span class=\"er-p er-p0\">(</span>a<span class=\"er-o\">|</span>ba<span class=\"er-k\">*</span>b<span class=\"er-p er-p0\">)</span><span class=\"er-k\">*</span></code>. Si la ER no sale as\u00ed, se toma el aut\u00f3mata y se pasa con la\n      Unidad 2: siempre funciona.\n    </p>\n\n    <div class=\"caja caja-ojo\">\n      <span class=\"caja-tit\">Errores y trampas</span>\n      <ul>\n        <li>En el \"o\" con AFND, no unir los dos aut\u00f3matas compartiendo un estado con lazos: los lazos de uno arruinan al otro. Un inicial nuevo con \u03b5 es lo seguro.</li>\n        <li>En el \"y\", nombr\u00e1 los estados con las dos informaciones (PP, PI...): as\u00ed no te perd\u00e9s al dibujar.</li>\n        <li>Fijate si la consigna dice \"AFD o AFND\" (eleg\u00eds) o solo \"AFD\".</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"bloque\">\n    <p class=\"kicker\">La segunda mitad</p>\n    <h2>4. La ER</h2>\n\n    <p>Cuando la consigna pide tambi\u00e9n la ER, hay dos caminos:</p>\n    <div class=\"tabla-wrap\">\n      <table class=\"t full\">\n        <tr><th>Camino</th><th>Cu\u00e1ndo conviene</th></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">Por piezas</td><td>Cuando el lenguaje se describe como \"una cosa, despu\u00e9s otra\": empieza con, termina con, contiene, bloques</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">Desde el aut\u00f3mata</td><td>Cuando hay paridades, \"no contiene\" o condiciones combinadas: se pasa el AF a ER con la Unidad 2</td></tr>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n\n    <h3>Por piezas</h3>\n    <ol>\n      <li>Part\u00ed la cadena en pedazos que se lean en orden: principio, medio, final.</li>\n      <li>Escrib\u00ed cada pedazo: lo fijo como est\u00e1, lo que se repite con <code class=\"er\"><span class=\"er-k\">*</span></code>, las opciones con <code class=\"er\"><span class=\"er-o\">|</span></code>.</li>\n      <li>Concaten\u00e1 los pedazos.</li>\n    </ol>\n\n    <h3 class=\"h-ej\">Ejemplo 1: identificadores</h3>\n    <div class=\"caja caja-ejemplo\">\n      <p>Identificadores que empiezan con una letra y siguen con letras o d\u00edgitos, sobre {L, D} (L = letra, D = d\u00edgito).</p>\n    </div>\n    <ul>\n      <li>Principio: una letra, <code>L</code>.</li>\n      <li>Resto: letras o d\u00edgitos, cualquier cantidad: <code class=\"er\"><span class=\"er-p er-p0\">(</span>L<span class=\"er-o\">|</span>D<span class=\"er-p er-p0\">)</span><span class=\"er-k\">*</span></code>.</li>\n      <li>ER: <code class=\"er\">L<span class=\"er-p er-p0\">(</span>L<span class=\"er-o\">|</span>D<span class=\"er-p er-p0\">)</span><span class=\"er-k\">*</span></code>.</li>\n    </ul>\n    <p>Las consignas con alfabeto \"simb\u00f3lico\" (L, D, M, N, o...) son as\u00ed: cada letra representa una clase de caracteres y se usa como un s\u00edmbolo m\u00e1s.</p>\n\n    <h3 class=\"h-ej\">Ejemplo 2: exactamente dos a</h3>\n    <div class=\"caja caja-ejemplo\">\n      <p>Cadenas sobre {a, b} con exactamente dos a.</p>\n    </div>\n    <ul>\n      <li>Las a son fijas; entre ellas, antes y despu\u00e9s, solo b: <code class=\"er\">b<span class=\"er-k\">*</span>ab<span class=\"er-k\">*</span>ab<span class=\"er-k\">*</span></code>.</li>\n      <li>Prueba: <code>aa</code> (todas las <code class=\"er\">b<span class=\"er-k\">*</span></code> en cero) s\u00ed; <code>baba</code> s\u00ed; <code>abaa</code> no (tiene tres a).</li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <h3 class=\"h-ej\">Ejemplo 3: desde el aut\u00f3mata</h3>\n    <p>\n      Para \"empiezan con a y tienen cantidad par de b\" (secci\u00f3n 3), se toma el AFD y se eliminan\n      estados: queda <code class=\"er\">a<span class=\"er-p er-p0\">(</span>a<span class=\"er-o\">|</span>ba<span class=\"er-k\">*</span>b<span class=\"er-p er-p0\">)</span><span class=\"er-k\">*</span></code>. Es el mismo procedimiento de la Unidad 2, y sirve de\n      control: si la ER por piezas y la del aut\u00f3mata no generan lo mismo, alguna est\u00e1 mal.\n    </p>\n\n    <div class=\"caja caja-ojo\">\n      <span class=\"caja-tit\">Errores y trampas</span>\n      <ul>\n        <li>La ER y el aut\u00f3mata tienen que describir <strong>el mismo</strong> lenguaje: prob\u00e1 las mismas cadenas en los dos.</li>\n        <li>\"Longitud m\u00ednima 2\", \"al menos uno\": no te olvides de forzarlo en la ER (un s\u00edmbolo fijo antes del <code class=\"er\"><span class=\"er-k\">*</span></code>).</li>\n        <li>Si una ER por piezas se complica mucho, pas\u00e1 al camino del aut\u00f3mata: siempre funciona.</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>");
